<!-- Akasha Plex-style Up Next card (B1): the post-play screen Plex
     shows between episodes. Next episode's art behind a scrim, a card
     with the episode thumbnail, identity line, countdown and the two
     actions. Play-now holds the default focus; Back cancels like the
     Cancel button. Countdown/layout values are parameters in
     up_next.py pending on-screen measurement against real Plex. -->
<window type="dialog" id="1204">
    <defaultcontrol>6404</defaultcontrol>
    <controls>
